      "name": "Spellcasting",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/item-bag.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The keeper of the grove is a 12th-level spellcaster. Its spellcasting ability is Wisdom (spell save DC 16, +8 to hit with spell attacks). It has the following druid spells prepared: Cantrips (at will): <em>druidcraft, resistance, solar wrath</em> 1st level (4 slots): <em>beast bond, detect poison and disease, entangle, cure wounds</em> 2nd level (3 slots): <em>beast sense, locate animals and plants, spike growth</em> 3rd level (3 slots): <em>mass healing word, revivify, plant growth</em> 4th level (3 slots): <em>conjure woodland beings, grasping vine, guardian of nature</em> 5th level (2 slots): <em>tree stride, wrath of nature</em> 6th level (1 slot): <em>wall of thorns</em></p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
